sequenceDiagram
    actor F as Facility staff
    participant W as Web app
    participant FS as Facility service
    participant D as Database

    F->>W: Open Facility Management
    W->>FS: addFacility(userId, name, capacity)
    FS->>FS: Check role is facility staff
    FS->>D: Insert FACILITY row
    FS-->>W: Facility saved
    F->>W: Blocked period and reason
    W->>FS: addBlock(userId, facilityId, slot, reason)
    FS->>FS: Check role is facility staff
    FS->>D: Insert FACILITY_BLOCK (created_by = staff)
    FS-->>W: Block saved
    W-->>F: Show block in the facility schedule
